Z||000004||HYPTNOTiSE||08-12-2000||05:24 PM||||Go for it man. Get a basic wet kit from Nos and start small like a 20-30 shot, you will actually hardly be able to tell the difference. But see what happens, especially if your engine is 86 or earlier, cos they're a dime a dozen. I'll give you one if you blow yours.<P>------------------<BR>       Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ Nitrous<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/hypsig.gif"> ||||reg||1
